OL,3,ABereaved families could face 'unjust'
OL,4,Atax bill after civil service pension
OL,5,Adelays
OL,6,
OL,7,FBereaved families affected by severe
OL,8,Fdelays paying out civil service
OL,9,Fpensions could face an "unjust" tax
OL,10,Fbill, the government has been warned.
OL,12,FUnder HMRC rules, certain lump sum
OL,13,Fpension payments must be paid within
OL,14,Ftwo years of the pension scheme being
OL,15,Fnotified of a death to remain tax-free.
OL,17,FConservative MP Sir Geoffrey
OL,18,FClifton-Brown, who chairs Parliament's
OL,19,FPublic Accounts Committee, said it was
OL,20,F"unconscionable" some families could
OL,21,Fface a "death tax" through no fault of
OL,22,Ftheir own.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,117,105,200,300,0,100
