OL,3,ABereaved families could face 'unjust'
OL,4,Atax bill after civil service pension
OL,5,Adelays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Cabinet Office said that if delays
OL,8,Fcaused a tax charge there were existing
OL,9,Favenues to claim compensation, such as
OL,10,Fthe Pensions Ombudsman.
